**Version**: 0.2
**Created**: 2026-07-10
**Status**: OPERATIONAL (2026-07-10). CXC-FLAUTH-C1…C11 all PASS. Delivered by Fable: `LogicWidget` (`render/widgets/logic.py`, 0×0, no draw — the ＋Logic carrier); static introspection `engine/headless.py` `introspect_ports()`/`is_logic_spec()`/`expr_namespaces()`; first-class output wires (`author_output_wire`) + node-drop inputs (`author_logic_input`) round-tripping byte-identically; the FlowInspectorPanel logic card (schedule picker, inline live ports, per-output expr editor live-validated by `dsl.try_parse`, deploy card); deploy write-side on the SAME Pass-1 loader contract (`save_roster`/`save_widget` + `resolve.put_bytes`/`put_text` bus_storage PUT) via a `composer/deploy/push` bus command. Confirmation tier live: port values ride discovery (zero new producer); runtime heartbeat to `_bus/headless/<rid>/health` is **opt-in** (`HeadlessRuntime(heartbeat_s=)`, default OFF so goldens/deterministic drives are untouched; CLI daemon defaults 1s), intercepted into a separate registry so it never pollutes the Bus·Live rail. Pass-4 seam reserved: `HEADLESS_BUS_PREFIX="_bus/headless"` declared + the "Inspect ▸ · P4" affordance a verified no-op. Evidence: **662 tests green macOS** (633→+29, `test_flow_headless_authoring.py`); author→deploy→run proven in-suite AND via `smoke_flauth_mqtt.py` 9/9 against real bus_storage:8420 + MQTT:1883 (Composer authors → pushes roster → a runtime fetches+runs → Composer's node reads live values + heartbeat); projection invariant held (Intelligence-vs-UI byte-identical YAML).

Ratified (David 2026-07-10, from Fable's SUMMARY): logic-node marker = the widget-level `headless:` block (NOT `outputs:` — a visual widget with an output wire stays a widget node); deploy assignment persists as a top-level `deploy: {runtime_id, widgets}` raw-spec passthrough key (name accepted); the multi-input authoring rule ([CXC-FLAUTH-CREATE]). New engine seams worth their own spec nodes (loader `save_*` write-side + `resolve.put_bytes` deploy-write contract; the `composer/deploy/push`→`pushed` bus command; the `logic` widget type) — folded here, promote if reused. Minor follow-ups: smoke artifacts left at `bus://assets/headless/flauth-smoke-*` on the production store (no delete API in `resolve` — infra TODO); previs glyphs (λ/∞/⏱/⚡) are outside the baked font atlas so `fx` + ASCII schedule text were used (atlas addition is a later polish).

Diagnosis tier remains Pass 4 ([CXC-HW-INTROSPECT]).
